      "description": "Slip-white card; brass-rimmed pan; leaf edge and badge once on the bill.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-prod ds-in\"><span class=\"ds-pan\">🍅</span><span class=\"ds-names\"><b>തക്കാളി</b><small>Tomato</small></span><span class=\"ds-rate\">₹40 / kg</span><span class=\"ds-badge\">500 g</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-prod{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;width:170px;min-height:152px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #E1D9C8;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;color:#1C2620;text-align:left;font-family:'Anek Malayalam',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(60,45,15,.06),0 3px 10px rgba(60,45,15,.06);cursor:pointer;transition:transform 160ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)} .ds-prod:active{transform:scale(.97)} .ds-prod:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #7A5610;outline-offset:2px} .ds-in{border-color:#1E6B3A;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #1E6B3A,0 1px 2px rgba(60,45,15,.06),0 3px 10px rgba(60,45,15,.06)} .ds-pan{display:grid;place-items:center;width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:#E2EED9;font:27px/1 'Noto Color Emoji','Apple Color Emoji',sans-serif;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(184,134,43,.3)} .ds-names{display:flex;flex-direction:column} .ds-names b{font-size:17.5px;font-weight:640;line-height:1.3;font-stretch:90%} .ds-names small{font-size:13px;color:#4B584F} .ds-rate{margin-top:auto;font-size:15px;font-weight:640;color:#154F2A} .ds-badge{position:absolute;top:12px;right:10px;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#1E6B3A;color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:650}"
